{"resource": {"name": "Monthly Library Statistics", "id": "y879-3vfy", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "This dataset contains monthly statistics on the usage of Fulton County Library digital resources including digital circulation, number of users and number of website visits.\nThis data is in long format compared to its cousin: https://sharefulton.fultoncountyga.gov/dataset/Monthly-Library-Statistics-Excel-Version-/82c5-zfg9", "attribution": "Fulton County Government", "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2023-01-03T22:40:06.000Z", "createdAt": "2021-02-16T17:11:03.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2022-05-09T18:04:59.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2023-01-03T22:40:06.000Z", "columns_name": ["Year", "Data", "Source", "Type", "Funding Objects Grouping", "Category", "MonthYoY", "Current Year", "Count", "Order", "Month"], "columns_field_name": ["year", "data", "source", "type", "fundingobjects", "category", "monthyoy", "currentyear", "count", "order", "month"], "columns_datatype": ["Number", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Calendar date", "Text", "Number", "Text", "Calendar date"], "columns_description": ["The year the data was collected.  This is useful for making graphs that aggregate the data by year. ", "Name for each Libary Key Performance Indicator. This the common business name for the datasource", "The datasource of the Fulton County Library Data.  This is it s actually datasource name that should match the url or software collecting the data", "The data category or type of library data based on the source it comes from and what it is measuring. ", "The broad funding category for library monthly statistics.  It is either the VIRTUAL statistics - (# of books, users, session/views, wifi connections) or PHYSICAL statistics (# of books, userbarcodes, footfall traffic, physical curbside cars)\nBoth virtual and physical categories maps 1 to 1 to multiple different Funding Line Object Cods and Object Names in the Budget and have different funding requirements.  Category is a sub-funding category to Funding Object Grouping.  Type and Source are thus the sub-sub-funding category to Funding Object Grouping.  ", "Category is the grouping of different data sources to match the color coated data source headings in the library analysts of original excel sheet. in other words, these correspond to the groupings of virtual library statistics that the library analysts are used to doing by hand", "The Month and Year that the data was collected.  This is useful for making that are aggregated by only month and year. ", "", "KPI Value", "the internal index to keep track of the automation workflow.  Each order should map 1 to 1 to a category, so its like an id column for category.", "The Month t"], "columns_format": [{"noCommas": "true"}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {"view": "date"}, {}, {}, {}, {"view": "date"}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2022-04-27T13:40:21.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": [], "tags": [], "domain_category": "Health & Human Services", "domain_tags": ["library"], "domain_metadata": [{"key": "Classification_Access-Level", "value": "Public"}, {"key": "Origination_Agency", "value": "Fulton County Public Library"}, {"key": "Origination_Source-System", "value": "various"}, {"key": "Coverage_Spatial-Coverage", "value": "Greater Metropolitan Atlanta Region to include both Alpharetta, South Fulton, and Dekalb  "}, {"key": "Coverage_Temporal-Coverage", "value": "2018 to Last Month"}, {"key": "Availibility_Update-Frequency", "value": "Monthly"}, {"key": "Quality_Data-Quality-Compliant", "value": "Yes"}]}, "metadata": {"domain": "sharefulton.fultoncountyga.gov", "license": "Creative Commons Attribution | Noncommercial 3.0 Unported"}, "permalink": "https://sharefulton.fultoncountyga.gov/d/y879-3vfy", "link": "https://sharefulton.fultoncountyga.gov/Health-Human-Services/Monthly-Library-Statistics/y879-3vfy", "owner": {"id": "eg9k-55je", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Patel, Abhi"}, "creator": {"id": "eg9k-55je", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "Patel, Abhi"}}
